Spec: SpecDD Structure View Factory

Platform: IntelliJ Platform / Kotlin

Purpose:
  Connect SpecDD structure entries to IntelliJ Structure view.

Owns:
  ./SpecDDStructureViewFactory.kt

Can modify:
  ./SpecDDStructureViewFactory.kt

Can read:
  ./SpecDDStructureModel.kt
  /src/main/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/SpecDDPsiFile.kt
  /src/test/kotlin/ai/specdd/idea/structure/SpecDDStructureViewFactoryBehaviorSpec.kt

Must:
  Implement IntelliJ `@PsiStructureViewFactory`.
  Return a tree-based structure view builder for `@SpecDDPsiFile`.
  Return no builder for non-SpecDD PSI files.
  Build structure models from current file text.
  Use one root node for the file and one child node per extracted section.
  Use section display names from `@SpecDDStructureSection`.
  Navigate section nodes to their stored section start offsets when a virtual file is available.
  Use the SpecDD file icon for structure presentations.

Must not:
  Define section extraction rules directly.
  Report validation diagnostics.
  Define syntax highlighting behavior.
